# Navigation & shell

- **Chrome unifié (A, 2026-09-02)** — rail + header share `--color-chrome`
  (`#0f1728`). No rail `border`. Workspace = `--color-canvas` with
  `--shell-workspace-radius` (`--space-12`, 12px) on the start-start corner.
- **Rail**: Accueil lockup (`PlayUpLockupMark` + `PlayUpWordmark surface="chrome"`)
  on top → grouped destinations → collapse control **inside** the rail footer.
  Collapsed width `--shell-rail-width-collapsed` (3.5rem); the workspace grows.
  Collapse keeps labels/wordmark in the tree and clips+fades them with the
  width (no `visually-hidden` snap — that caused a horizontal scrollbar flash
  and a lockup jump). `overflow-x: hidden` on the rail. Nav `overflow-y: auto`.
  Nav labels: `--font-weight-regular` (groups stay semibold uppercase meta).
- **Groups**: Pilotage (Cockpit) · Compétition (Structure, Calendrier & matchs,
  Classements) · Référentiel (Équipes, Stades, Règlement — visible, no routes yet).
- **Current item**: inset chip (`--shell-rail-item-radius` / `--radius-panel`),
  wash `--shell-rail-wash-current`, **straight** 3px `--color-chrome-accent` bar
  flush start, clipped by overflow. **Not** `--brand-skew`. Idle: no wash, full
  `on-chrome` opacity. Hover wash 8%; current+hover 16%. Current hover keeps
  accent on label + icon — only the wash changes.
- **Header** (on chrome, aligned with the workspace column): `TeamCrest` `lg`
  (no white plate — same Accueil crest grammar) + name (`--text-heading`) +
  Accueil status badge (`soft`, `compact`) + dates · À traiter bell + badge. No swap, no
  wordmark, no profile. Mark → Accueil.
- Classes: `ds-shell-rail`, `ds-shell-header`, `ds-shell-workspace` in
  `foundations/shell.css`.
- Nav icons: `design-system/icons/shellIcons.tsx`.
